What is TypeScript?
- Programming language 
- Superset of the JavaScript language; extends the JavaScript language
- Browsers do not understand TS
- Allows us to use Strict types
- Supports modern features like arrows, let, const
- Extra features like interfaces, tuples, and generics

What you should know beforehand:
- Understand JavaScript basics
- What the DOM is
- Classes

Installation Details :
- Download Node.js for Windows/ Mac : https://nodejs.org/en/download
   Go through the installation code
- Install Visual Studio Code: https://code.visualstudio.com/download
- Install the TypeScript compiler - Go to Command Prompt  and type the command below : 
    npm install -g typescript
  To check if TypeScript has been installed successfully, type the command below
    tsc -v




